## How to Run the Tests

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ksakthi23/django-payments-track-1.git
cd django-payments-track-1
```

Create and activate a virtual environment:

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -e ".[test]"
```

Run the test suite:

```bash
python -m pytest --cov=payments --cov-branch --cov-report=term-missing -q -o addopts=''
```

## Project Objective

The main objective of this project is to improve the reliability and quality of Django payment processing by strengthening automated testing, validating payment workflows, and reducing untested code paths.

